n83|a|Surpassing; extraordinary; distinguished (in a bad sense); -- formerly used with words importing a good quality, but now joined with words having a bad sense; as, an egregious rascal; an egregious ass; an egregious mistake.	j:6xw,55,5;pad,55,12~pad,55,12;6xw,55,5	e:1gns,71,23;242e,62,5;pf6,34,4;1oar,27,8~1gns,71,23;1oar,27,8;242e,62,5;pf6,34,4
